# Architecture

## Monorepo

- apps/web-shell - Host MFE (owns auth routes)
- apps/web-accounts - Accounts MFE (remote)
- apps/mobile - React Native
- packages/core - Shared business logic (@repo/core)
- packages/ui-web - Web design system (@repo/ui)

## Core Package (@repo/core)

Shared types, schemas, services, and utilities:

```
packages/core/src/
├── adapters/       # HttpClient, SecureStorage interfaces
├── domains/        # auth, accounts, transfers
│   └── [domain]/
│       ├── types.ts
│       ├── schema.ts
│       ├── service.ts
│       ├── queries.ts
│       └── index.ts
└── shared/         # utils, constants
```

## Feature Structure (Apps)

```
features/[name]/
├── components/
├── hooks/          # useAccounts, useCreateTransfer
├── screens/        # Mobile only
├── [Name]Page.tsx  # Web only
└── index.ts
```

## Service Pattern (Adapter)

```typescript
// @repo/core - service factory
export function createAccountsService(http: HttpClient) {
  return {
    getAll: () => http.get('/accounts'),
  };
}

// App - wire with platform adapter
import { httpClient } from '@/adapters/http.web';
export const accountsService = createAccountsService(httpClient);
```

## Import Rules

- Features: import from shared/, @repo/*, and @/services
- Never import between features
- Import types/schemas from @repo/core/domains/*
- Import services from @/services (app-wired)

## Package Naming

| Package | Import | Folder |
|---------|--------|--------|
| Core | @repo/core | packages/core |
| Web UI | @repo/ui | packages/ui-web |

